        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>参考答案</title>\n<script type=\"text/javascript\" id=\"MathJax-script\" async\n  src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\">\n</script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    font-family: \"SimSun\", \"Songti SC\", serif;\n    background: #fff;\n    color: #111;\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n  }\n  .page {\n    max-width: 700px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 40px 45px 60px 45px;\n    position: relative;\n    min-height: 900px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n  .watermark {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\n    align-content: space-around;\n    justify-content: space-around;\n    pointer-events: none;\n    z-index: 0;\n    overflow: hidden;\n  }\n  .watermark span {\n    color: rgba(150,150,150,0.18);\n    font-size: 22px;\n    transform: rotate(-25deg);\n    white-space: nowrap;\n  }\n  .content {\n    position: relative;\n    z-index: 1;\n  }\n  h1.title {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 26px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    letter-spacing: 4px;\n    margin: 10px 0 35px 0;\n  }\n  .item {\n    margin-bottom: 18px;\n  }\n  .item .qline {\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    margin-bottom: 4px;\n  }\n  .item .detail {\n    font-size: 14px;\n    line-height: 1.9;\n    text-align: justify;\n    margin: 0;\n  }\n  .item .detail .label {\n    font-weight: bold;\n  }\n  .item .kd {\n    font-size: 14px;\n    line-height: 1.9;\n    margin: 2px 0 0 0;\n  }\n  .item .kd .label {\n    font-weight: bold;\n  }\n  .footer {\n    position: absolute;\n    bottom: 15px;\n    left: 0;\n    right: 0;\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    color: #333;\n    z-index: 1;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <div class=\"watermark\">\n    <span>上学吧-金搜题库</span><span>上学吧-金搜题库</span><span>上学吧-金搜题库</span>\n    <span>上学吧-金搜题库</span><span>上学吧-金搜题库</span><span>上学吧-金搜题库</span>\n    <span>上学吧-金搜题库</span><span>上学吧-金搜题库</span><span>上学吧-金搜题库</span>\n    <span>上学吧-金搜题库</span><span>上学吧-金搜题库</span><span>上学吧-金搜题库</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"content\">\n    <h1 class=\"title\">参考答案：</h1>\n\n    <div class=\"item\">\n      <div class=\"qline\">1. A</div>\n      <p class=\"detail\"><span class=\"label\">【详解】</span>句意：许多衣服正在特价出售，但是很少是好的。</p>\n      <p class=\"detail\">few 很少的，修饰可数名词；a few 一些，修饰可数名词；little 很少的，修饰不可数名词；a little 一点，修饰不可数名词。根据 many clothes 是可数名词，故排除CD两项。根据but可知，前半句表示很多衣服在低价出售，后半句表示它们很少是好的，故选A。</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"item\">\n      <div class=\"qline\">2. B</div>\n      <p class=\"detail\"><span class=\"label\">【详解】</span>试题分析：句意：--你最喜欢谁，科比，詹姆斯还是乔丹？--都不喜欢。林书豪是我最喜欢的篮球运动员。分析：考查代词的用法，all 三者以上都；none 三者以上都不；each 每一个；either 两者中的任何一个。分析：选项中提到的是三个人，通过语境体现三者都不喜欢，因此选择代词none.故选 B</p>\n      <p class=\"kd\"><span class=\"label\">考点：</span>考查代词的用法。</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"item\">\n      <div class=\"qline\">3. B</div>\n      <p class=\"detail\"><span class=\"label\">【详解】</span>句意：迈克有两个姐妹。她们俩都不喜欢牛奶，但他非常喜欢。</p>\n      <p class=\"detail\">考查代词。None（三者或三者以上）都不；Neither 两者都不；Each 每个；根据“Mike has two sisters.”可知，此处指的是“two sisters”，再结合“but he loves it very much.”可知，前句说的是两个姐妹都不喜欢牛奶，故选B。</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"item\">\n      <div class=\"qline\">4. B</div>\n      <p class=\"detail\"><span class=\"label\">【详解】</span>句意“我们仍然有一点鸡蛋在冰箱里”。a bit and a little修饰形容词、副词、动词或比较级，排除A和D，egg为可数名词，much修饰不可数名词，排除C，a few译为\"有一点\"，修饰可数名词，表示肯定，故选B。</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"item\">\n      <div class=\"qline\">5. C</div>\n      <p class=\"detail\"><span class=\"label\">【详解】</span>句意：——Sally，你还想吃点别的吗？——不，谢谢。我现在饱了。</p>\n      <p class=\"detail\">考查复合不定代词以及形容词的位置。anything任何事物；nothing没什么；something某物。形容词else修饰不定代词时，要放在其后，排除A和D选项。此句是表示请求的疑问句，应用something，故选C。</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"item\">\n      <div class=\"qline\">6.